# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Layout:  TradingView/indicators, TradingView/strategies   original Pine sources
#          TrendSpider/indicators, TrendSpider/strategies   the conversions (committed)
#
# TradingView/ holds other authors' code. Of 1,977 sources, 75 % declare no licence
# (all rights reserved by default) and only 23 % are MPL 2.0, so it stays LOCAL while
# this repository is public. Every conversion in TrendSpider/ credits its author and
# declared licence, and is also saved in the owner's TrendSpider account as <Title>_TV.
TradingView/
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Validation outputs and bar fixtures — market data has its own licence terms.
validation/

# TrendSpider's captured engine is proprietary: never commit it, or anything from it.
*runtime_bundle*
00_pretty.js
node_modules/

# Python / local
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.claude/settings.local.json
